: mark ( u -- ) dup buffer dup b/buf bl fill  >r s" \ screen " r@ swap cmove  (.) r> 9 + swap cmove  update ;
: marks ( from to -- ) 1+ swap ?do i mark loop ;
20 31 marks
empty-buffers
20 31 index
32 33 marks  flush  empty-buffers
32 33 index
34 mark  save-buffers  empty-buffers  34 34 index
\ emptying the buffers while a LOAD reads one leaves that one alone (defect 38)
: pins. ( -- ) #buffers 0 do i pinned? . loop ;
40 wipe  0 >line \ empty-buffers and flush during a load
1 >line empty-buffers flush  1 2 + .
save-buffers  40 load  pins.
: load-many ( -- ) 9 0 do 40 load loop ;  load-many  pins.  41 block drop  42 block drop
\ a LOAD stopped between its pin and its catch keeps no pin once the error is caught (TD-43)
41 block drop  last-buf @ pin  1 0 /
empty-buffers  41 buf-of .
\ the pins leave apps room for seven user variables (defect 46)
/user next-user @ - 1 cells / .
